        VoiceLine(160, Brighton, ru="Одно то, что на встрече с вами присутствует принцесса Кейтлин, должно о многом вам говорить.", en="That her royal highness is in attendance should inform even someone like you of the gravity of this matter, and perhaps hint at the bare modicum of decorum necessitated. We would most appreciate it if you could take this just a little seriously."),
